      {
        "id": "en.n8.c30.e04",
        "format": "escribir",
        "prompt": {
          "es": "Repara el conflicto: localiza dos errores y responde (75-190 palabras)."
        },
        "answer": {
          "text": "The note has two tone problems: it gives a rude order with capital letters, and it blames me with the word always. Here is my reply. Dear Mr Hill, I am sorry that the music disturbed you last night. I understand that it is difficult to sleep when there is noise. I would like to propose a solution: I will turn the music down after ten every evening, and I will tell my guests too. Would that be convenient for you? Thank you for your patience, and please tell me if there is any other problem. Kind regards, Carlos",
          "accepted": [
            "The note has two tone problems: it gives a rude order with capital letters, and it blames me with the word always. Here is my reply. Dear Mr Hill, I am sorry that the music disturbed you last night. I understand that it is difficult to sleep when there is noise. I would like to propose a solution: I will turn the music down after ten every evening, and I will tell my guests too. Would that be convenient for you? Thank you for your patience, and please tell me if there is any other problem. Kind regards, Carlos",
            "The note is rude for two reasons: the order with capital letters and the word always which blames me. My reply: Dear Mr Hill, I apologise that my music disturbed you. I know that noise at night makes it hard to sleep. I would like to suggest a solution: from now on, I will keep the music down after ten, and my friends will know the rule. Would that be convenient for you? Thank you very much for telling me. Yours sincerely, Carlos"
          ]
        },
